			<p>Witness the crush of people in front of the 10-foot-wide window into Wrigley Field. Where they congregated before 2006, when the knothole in the outfield wall was carved, I do not know. But they are together now.</p>
			</a>
		</div>
        
        
		<div class="poetry">
