			<h3>Poetry</h3>
			<h2>The First Practice</h2>
			<h4>By David S. Pointer</h4>
			<p>"The coach poured the / extra balls out of a / red drawstring bucket / bag, then the kids took / the mini-field forever / shagging long, left, right."</p>
			</a>
